[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14599.07, "timestamp": "04:03:19", "text": "呃，沒事的。別太擔心，告訴我一聲就好。好的，我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14604.15, "timestamp": "04:03:24", "text": "呃，我看到你了。 [音樂]呃，是寶藏。我會發的。我只是有點擔心。希望我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14606.389, "timestamp": "04:03:26", "text": "沒冒犯你。你好，Mink。呃，我擔心……你好嗎，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14609.229, "timestamp": "04:03:29", "text": "Mink？好久不見了。你好嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14619.42, "timestamp": "04:03:39", "text": "，Dio"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14623.79, "timestamp": "04:03:43", "text": "？ Taka小姐。未剪輯版。你好。希望沒關係。我"}]